  "title": "Defining Priorities for Small Insurers in a Dynamic Marketplace",
  "summary": "The changing insurance marketplace sees new ideas proposed regularly. Although many of these don’t translate to revenue generation, a few disruptive ideas do stand out. A recent estimate indicates that the number of insurtech players operating today is in the thousands. They’re working on various stages of the insurance lifecycle, from easier onboarding to faster claims processing.",
